  data: {
    LLM: "Only buy the current High Trump (e.g., King) if many cards are already revealed and the Ace hasn't shown up. The price should reflect the probability of it being beaten. If you hold a face-down card, you can sell it for a mystery price.\n\nThe 'Sucker' Bet: Don't buy a Queen of Trumps early in the game. It will likely be beaten. Wait until the Ace/King are accounted for.\n\nMarket Manipulation: If you hold the High Trump, talk it up. Try to sell it before a better card appears. If you buy, lowball.",
